Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.32,0:00:04.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}First track: fast surrogates,\Nnetworks trained to imitate a solver.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.58,0:00:09.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Some carry the equations in their loss;\Nothers learn maps between whole fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.61,0:00:14.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}For conducting fluids, they now reach\Nflat, two-dimensional turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:17.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}For the Earth, recall the\Ntwenty twenty-two study:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.19,0:00:20.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}the methods it tried could\Nnot reliably foresee a flip.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.77,0:00:25.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}Their weak spot: trained to\Nminimize a mean-square error,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:28.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}ensembles of them\Nregress to the mean flow.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.82,0:00:32.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,100)\move(960,1020,960,1016,0,120)}A cloud with two polarities\Ncollapses to its middle.
